ly worth a watch and  i'm excited for everyone to see this and  talk about it it's gonna get a lot of  buzz because it's some crazy stuff and  i'm not gonna spoil any of that of  course because you have to enjoy that  magic on first watch without knowing  anything going in i wouldn't even watch  a trailer just go in cold and really  just take it in and you know just be  happy we have someone who's still doing  great comedy like nathan fielder so let  me know if you plan to watch i'd love to  hear your comments about it anything  what you thought nathan for you as well  what do you think nathan fielders work  as a whole i'd love to hear that if you  plan on watching this and let me know  when you do watch what you thought i'd  love to hear that as well please follow  me at steve barley show on twitter  instagram and tick tock for more of me  and i'll see you next time

